{"file":"about-escrow-CJm_3uiq.js","mappings":";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;AAoBA,eAAW;AAAA,MACT,OAAO;AAAA,MACP,aAAa;AAAA,IACf,CAAC;;AAtBO,YAAA,QAAAA,eAAAC,WAAA,EAAA,OAAM,uCAAmC,MAAA,CAAA,CAAA,imCAAA;AAAA;;;;;;;;;","names":["_ssrRenderAttrs","_mergeProps"],"sources":["../../../../pages/about-escrow.vue"],"sourcesContent":["<template>\n  <main class=\"min-h-screen bg-white pt-24 pb-16\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6\">How Escrow Works</h1>\n      <div class=\"prose prose-lg text-slate-600\">\n        <p>At Erranders Barter, we prioritize your safety above all else. Our Escrow system ensures that buyers get their items and sellers get paid without any risk of scams.</p>\n        \n        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-8 mb-4\">1. Agreement & Payment</h3>\n        <p>When a buyer wants an item, they pay the agreed amount into the secure Erranders Escrow account. The seller is instantly notified that funds are secured.</p>\n        \n        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-8 mb-4\">2. Delivery</h3>\n        <p>The seller hands over the item to the buyer directly or through Erranders Logistics. Since the money is held in Escrow, both parties are confident in proceeding.</p>\n\n        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-8 mb-4\">3. Verification & Payout</h3>\n        <p>The buyer inspects the item. Once they approve it on the platform, the funds are instantly released to the seller's wallet. If there's an issue, a dispute can be raised.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</template>\n<script setup>\nuseSeoMeta({\n  title: 'How Escrow Works | Erranders Barter',\n  description: 'Learn how our secure Escrow system protects you while buying, selling, and swapping items on campus.'\n})\n</script>\n"],"version":3}